        <span itemprop="definition">added to the separator, to reduce static charge.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0004">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">P-type conductors (electron conductors) or N-type conductors (hole conductors) materials</span>
