      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">This battery separator</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be produced from a film, where the film is a multi-layered film and the block copolymer is in the outer most layers of said multi-layered film or in all the layers.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0017">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the block copolymer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">works well, in the outer most layers of said tri-layered film.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0018">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the block copolymer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">can be in all the layers.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0018">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a lithium ion secondary battery</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is a cylindrical or prismatic battery composed of anode, cathode, separator, and electrolyte, which is packaged in a rigid (e.g., metallic) can or flexible foil.</span>
