    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00015" num="00015" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>15</b>. The battery separator of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00009">claim 9</claim-ref> wherein said film being a multi-layered film and said block copolymer being in the outer most layers of said multi-layered film. </div>
    </div>
